The boat moved very slowly through the water.
I sat quietly and watched the other passengers.
Most people sat watching the water.
Two older men sat opposite me.
They talked softly for some time.
Then, one of them wanted to read a newspaper.
He did not have his own newspaper with him.
So, he asked for and took his friend's newspaper.
The friend happily gave his own newspaper.
That man put on his glasses and started reading the newspaper.
Then I looked towards the shore.
There were small houses right on the edge of the water.
I wanted to take pictures of them.
I did not use my mobile phone.
Instead, I used my own camera.
I took a few pictures of those beautiful houses.
The people in those houses waved at the boat.
I also waved back at them.
